Chinese Call Speech Emotion Recognition: DACE and ACCR

Project inference code, project-trained LoRA adapters, direct classifier heads
and frozen calibration/routing parameters are released under the Apache License
2.0. No training, validation or test audio/text data is included.

The third-party Qwen2-Audio base weights are NOT redistributed in this
repository. The setup script downloads them from the official ModelScope
repository. Users must review and comply with that repository's license and
terms:

- Qwen/Qwen2-Audio-7B-Instruct (Alibaba Cloud), Apache License 2.0.

DACE and ACCR share the same two project-trained adapters. MVEF was used only
as a training-set out-of-fold soft teacher and is not a runtime dependency.
